  "long_prompt_note": "A model whose input price rises when ONE request's prompt passes a size: [needle, over_tokens, multiple, verified], matched by substring like prices. Haiku 5.5 costs 5x (0.50 in, and every cache price with it) once a prompt passes 100K tokens; verified = read from platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing on 2026-10-24 (self-verified). Applied only where one request's prompt size is known (gt_optimize_session.py reads it per turn); gt_savings.py's ledger events are totals, so there a long Haiku prompt is priced at the base tier and is under-stated (unverified). A row with no verified date is refused by the reader.",
